  "releaseNotes": "### External agents\n\n- A setup guide walks you through connecting an external agent to a Pudding conversation. You can hand the conversation to another agent after the current task finishes.\n- Pudding shows when an external agent is working. You can stop it from the conversation.\n- Agents can load widget instructions as needed. In long conversations, Pudding keeps older tool output and screenshots available to retrieve while using shorter references in the model context.\n\n### Long conversations and settings\n\n- Pudding can summarize a long conversation in batches when the history no longer fits in a single summary request.\n- Pudding asks before you leave assistant settings with unsaved changes.",
